 "topics": [
  {
   "id": "VHDKimballSpeech01",
   "section": "conversation",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Thank you, Colonel Moore. And thank you, my fellow Californians, who have come so far to answer the call to service put forth by the republic.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "It is for you that I have come here, and it is because of you that I am able to do so.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We enjoy our privileges because you take the greatest of risks and are prepared to make the most noble of sacrifices.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "It is because of men and women like Private First Class Jeremy Watson that Nevada and the New California Republic remain free and secure.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Born in a tin shack on the outskirts of One Pine, Jeremy Watson never had it easy.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "His father worked as a caravan guard on the Short Loop, and his mother, like many Californians, braved the ruins of the Old World as a prospector.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "They suffered through water shortages, raider attacks, and the Brotherhood War. Like our mighty Sierra Nevadas, they endured.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "But the time came when they could no longer shoulder the burden alone.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Twelve years ago, they called out for help, and the republic heard them. Troopers and rangers, just like you, answered the clarion call.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Men and women stepped forward to say, \"I will carry the weight.\"",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "And at Owen's Lake, we made true on our promise, driving out the raider tribes to establish a lasting peace in the eastern Sierra Nevadas.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We carried the weight, and though we left behind many of our brothers and sisters on that battlefield, it did not break us.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Ten years ago, Chief Elise met with representatives of the Desert Rangers to discuss terms of what would become the Ranger Unification Treaty.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "The treaty was more than a resolution to welcome the Desert Rangers into the republic.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "It was a covenant to protect southern Nevada against Caesar's Legion and the tyranny of his regime.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "There are some back home who ask me, \"But who are we protecting? What is Nevada to us?\"",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Sometimes we forget that the light of our society shines beyond our borders.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Sometimes we take those privileges for granted that our forebears fought so hard to achieve.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We must always remember that wherever Californians stand, we carry our principles with us:",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "equal respect, representation, and protection under the laws of a just republic.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "This was the same fire that burned in the heart of the Old World that preceded us.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We are the heirs of that civilization, torchbearers eastward of the Pacific, into the darkness of this wasted land.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "When the republic called on the men and women of California to carry that fire across the Mojave, Jeremy Watson answered. You answered.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Together, you carried the weight. And when PFC Watson's platoon came under attack at Forlorn Hope, he took the greatest risk,",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "not only for his fellow Californians, but for California itself.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "He was prepared to make the most noble of sacrifices, to defend the principles of our republic, even here, on Nevada soil.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "His actions are a beacon to all of us who stand here today in tribute to his valor.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Private First Class Jeremy Watson, on behalf of the senate and people of the New California Republic,",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "it is my honor to present you with the Star of Sierra Madre.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Not far from this spot, a monument stands as a tribute to the sacrifice made by those who came before us,",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "the men and women who fulfilled the promise we made to the Desert Rangers.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Its back is inscribed with the names of the troopers and rangers who carried the weight.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "And because they made the most noble of sacrifices, it did not break us.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Four years ago, we held this dam. Four years ago, we carried the weight.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Four years ago, we drew a line through the Mojave as clear as the Colorado River, a line that Caesar cannot cross.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Today, you stand here with our brothers and sisters to hold that line. Today, you honor all Californians by carrying that weight.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Today, you are the waves of the Pacific, pushing ever eastward. You are the sequoias rising from the Sierra Nevadas, defiant and enduring.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "You are the great western light of California, torchbearers in the darkness, living reminders of all that is best in our republic.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Thank you. Thank you.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Okay, let's get the fuck out of here. What the hell are you waiting for? You think I want to get shot? Let's go!",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
